sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Browser
  participant API as Next API
  participant Provider as Provider adapter
  User->>Browser: Load source and submit
  Browser->>API: GET health with cookie context
  API-->>Browser: Availability, order and limits
  Browser->>API: POST transcribe source and options
  API->>API: Validate, rate guard, resolve keys, plan
  API->>Provider: Recognition request
  alt Retryable failure and next eligible engine
    Provider-->>API: Normalized failure
    API->>Provider: Try next adapter
  end
  Provider-->>API: Result or terminal failure
  API->>API: Count attempt and best-effort release
  API-->>Browser: Normalized response and attempts
  Browser-->>User: Edit / export or recovery
